//// The `jhonstart-forms` package — module-tree root (front 67).
////
//// A form bound to a server action, its state, the in-flight status, the
//// optimistic value and the GET search form. The envelope, the `state` grammar
//// and the JSON-RPC body are the shared library `actions`' (decisions 116, 326):
//// this member reads and writes them through it and spells none of them. A
//// consumer writes `import {formAction, formAttrs, …} from "jhonstart-forms";`
//// beside `import {form, input, button} from "jhonstart";`.

pub mod form;
